DTEND;TZID=America/Denver:20261004T101500
SUMMARY:DRESS REHEARSAL — 3:00–3:15 by time (~20 mi)
DESCRIPTION:Rolling dirt\, 2\,000–2\,500 ft. ~55 min easy / 10 mi at ra
 ce effort = HR 150–156 (Boulder rolling dirt ~7:35–7:50/mi\, Nederla
 nd 7:55–8:10\, Breck 8:05–8:20) / ~50 min easy. Adios Pro 4\, race k
 it\, race fuel 60–90 g/hr\, one flask from the start. Run a −5% desc
 ent at 6:40–7:00 on purpose. Practice one 60 s stop then an immediate 
 9:00 climb.
END:VEVENT
