DTEND;TZID=America/Denver:20261023T083000
SUMMARY:Moab shakeout — first mile of the course
DESCRIPTION:2 mi very easy\, out and back on the first mile. Feel the san
 dy top layer in the race shoes. Drop the Rocket X Trail bag at The Pit.
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:49443454-12bf-530f-8f99-c14c67768fe0@canyonlands2026
DTSTAMP:20260922T203638Z
DTSTART;TZID=America/Denver:20261024T070000
DTEND;TZID=America/Denver:20261024T103000
SUMMARY:RACE — Canyonlands Ultra Marathon — 3:20
DESCRIPTION:7 AM start. Skip Buttes. Mile 2 at 9:25\, let the field go. M
 iles 10–11 at 7:03 / 6:38. The Pit ~57:30\, Oasis ~2:04:50\, The Pit ~
 2:44:00\, 60 s each. Climbs HR ≤158\, rollers 150–156\, descents 143
 –148. Gels at 9\, 14\, 19\, 23. Oasis decision: on plan → run it\; >
 2 min back → 8:00–8:15 home. Adios Pro 4.
END:VEVENT
END:VCALENDAR
